# Build context exclusions for the Sohba application image.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/
**/.git/
.github/
**/*.user

# Runtime data and local secrets - never baked into an image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
Sohba/wwwroot/uploads/
Sohba/ProtectedUploads/
Sohba/logs/
logs/
*.log

# Documentation and local tooling not needed by dotnet publish
Readme.md
ELASTICSEARCH.md
Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.gitignore
.gitattributes
*.md